---
title: Browser extension · binding a preview tab to the live session
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant tab as Session tab
  participant worker as Service worker
  participant page as Preview tab
  participant sdk as Embedded SDK
  participant cp as Control plane

  Note over sdk: Holds the page proof telemetry<br/>ingestion issued at activation.
  tab->>cp: request a binding offer
  cp-->>tab: single-use, short-lived offer
  tab->>worker: offer · externally connectable messaging
  Note over worker,sdk: The participant focuses a product or preview tab.
  worker->>sdk: page-proof probe · its own channel
  sdk-->>worker: page proof, forwarded verbatim
  alt exact valid proof
    worker->>cp: binding_offer + page proof · control connection
    Note over cp: Validates the offer, the<br/>installation's proof of<br/>possession, and the signature<br/>over the exact forwarded bytes.
    cp-->>worker: extension_binding_id · adopts the proof's document_attachment_id
    worker->>page: render the character and controls
  else no matching proof
    Note over worker,page: The tab is left untouched.
  end
  opt the session origin advances to a candidate
    tab->>cp: request a fresh offer
    cp-->>tab: offer naming the candidate's allocation
    tab->>worker: fresh offer
    worker->>page: keep the binding · reload the bound tab
    worker->>sdk: page-proof probe
    sdk-->>worker: new page proof naming the candidate
    worker->>cp: rebind
    cp-->>worker: binding on the candidate's allocation
  end
